  "scope": "Original fixed common-batch runner, registration, launch/runtime bindings, review, stop and terminal evidence. Failed during first source derivation; no common output qualified. Empty derive GNU-time file is preserved and supplies no timing or resource result. Partial spill payloads stay host-local; subsequent bounded diagnosis is separate evidence. Host launch paths are archival, not portable commands. Includes frozen bounded bad-row diagnostic, exact failure row, per-row results, source/parser evidence and losslessly gzip-compressed 1324-row original bank; no new labels or corrected raw observations. Includes unlaunched v2 direct-CLI proposal and existing synthetic spawned-worker error/success observations with their exact tiny fixtures; original v1 runtime remains unchanged. Includes completed fixed64-shard policy-support census, all excluded references and explicit limits of its finite/available value observation metric. Supplemental latest-phase value ambiguity pass is not included or completed here.",
